Error [E3301]: `live { … }` is not available in a freestanding build.
  --> tests/ui/live_freestanding_e3301.jet:3:5
    |
  3 |     live {
    |     ^^^^^^
 Why: `--freestanding` targets have no OS; only `core`-level APIs are available.
 Fix: Terminal I/O requires an OS terminal device. Build without `--freestanding`.
